---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title="About Stone Creek Exchange" description="A neighbor-led exchange for hobbies, skills, projects, and local sharing." />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main class="page">
      <section class="card">
        <p class="eyebrow">About the project</p>
        <h1>Stone Creek Exchange</h1>
        <p>Stone Creek Exchange is a resident-created community hub for sharing skills, hobbies, projects, and local connections. It begins with Lapis Place Nursery and grows into a broader neighborhood exchange over time.</p>
        <p>The platform is designed to feel like a digital bulletin board and community garden: practical, warm, and easy to maintain through simple Markdown content updates.</p>
      </section>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
